  "field_regression_findings": {
    "fps_limit_0_live_game_regression": "Although synthetic offscreen d3d11_probe scored highest with QEMURendererFPSLimit=0, live target-cn E2E revealed that QEMURendererFPSLimit=0 + --app-shell-vm causes on-demand redraw (text refreshes only on pointer movement) and stalls initial SwapChain Present after voice-chat init. Restoring QEMURendererFPSLimit=120 + --game-shell-vm + UTM_KEEP_CURSOR_VISIBLE_ON_INHIBIT=1 resolved redraw, cursor visibility, and game launch.",
    "socket_stream_tcp_boundary": "Phase 12A zero-privilege async_net_proxy implements ARP/DHCP/ICMP/UDP NAT only (no TCP NAT). Because ad-hoc signed UTM-Custom.app lacks com.apple.vm.networking entitlement, live target-cn HTTPS/TCP login required falling back to Emulated NIC; Developer ID signing (vmnet-shared) or full TCP/UDP gvproxy/socket_vmnet is required to eliminate the remaining 5 slirp warnings."
  }
